1
00:00:00,695 --> 00:00:02,325
(Leonard:)He's been in bed for two days.

2
00:00:02,488 --> 00:00:05,238
(Penny:)Yeah, probably with a blow-up doll.

3
00:00:06,409 --> 00:00:07,909
(Leonard:)He's not with a...

4
00:00:08,077 --> 00:00:10,827
(Leonard:)Does it really matter who
or what he's with?

5
00:00:10,997 --> 00:00:12,327
The... The guy is devastated.

6
00:00:12,498 --> 00:00:15,498
(Penny:)Oh, please.
How could I possibly devastate Howard?

7
00:00:16,210 --> 00:00:18,500
(Leonard:)Okay, don't take this as a criticism...

8
00:00:18,671 --> 00:00:22,721
...but you do kind of have that
overexposed-to-gamma-rays thing going on.

9
00:00:22,883 --> 00:00:24,213
(Penny:)What does that mean?

10
00:00:24,385 --> 00:00:27,225
(Leonard:)You know. Like, most of the time,
you're the easygoing Bruce Banner.

11
00:00:27,388 --> 00:00:30,388
(Leonard:)But then when you get angry,
you kind of turn into like, you know:

12
00:00:30,558 --> 00:00:32,558
[GROWLS]

13
00:00:34,395 --> 00:00:36,355
(Penny:)I turn into a bear?

14
00:00:37,273 --> 00:00:39,023
(Leonard:)Seriously? Gamma rays? Bruce Banner?

15
00:00:39,191 --> 00:00:41,821
(Leonard:)You didn't get The Incredible Hulk
from that?

16
00:00:42,236 --> 00:00:44,696
(Leonard:)Never mind.
Just... Please, just go talk to him.

17
00:00:44,864 --> 00:00:47,994
Oh, and say what? That I didn't mean it?
Because I meant it.

18
00:00:48,159 --> 00:00:50,619
(Leonard:)Well, maybe you can go at it
from a different angle.

19
00:00:50,786 --> 00:00:53,496
Like, you see a glimmer
of goodness in him...

20
00:00:53,664 --> 00:01:01,024
(Leonard:)...and you only said what you said because
you want to nurture it and make it shine.

